<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Acesso Bloqueado</title>

<style>
:root{
--tcu-blue:#003A8F;
--tcu-blue-dark:#002b68;
--tcu-green:#00A859;
--tcu-green-dark:#008347;
--tcu-yellow:#FFCC29;
--bg:#f3f6fb;
--card:#ffffff;
--text:#1f2937;
--muted:#6b7280;
--border:#d9e2f0;
--soft-blue:#eef4fb;
--soft-yellow:#fff7db;
--soft-green:#edf8f1;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box}

html,body{
margin:0;
padding:0;
font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f9fc 0%,#eef3f9 100%);
color:var(--text);
}

.topbar{
height:8px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--tcu-blue) 0%,var(--tcu-green) 55%,var(--tcu-yellow) 100%);
}

.wrap{
min-height:calc(100vh - 8px);
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
padding:32px 16px;
}

.card{
width:100%;
max-width:860px;
background:var(--card);
border:1px solid var(--border);
border-radius:18px;
box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
overflow:hidden;
}

.header{
padding:28px 32px 20px 32px;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,58,143,.04) 0%,rgba(0,168,89,.03) 100%);
border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.brand{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:18px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.brand img{
max-width:190px;
height:auto;
display:block;
}

.badge{
display:inline-flex;
align-items:center;
gap:8px;
padding:8px 12px;
background:var(--soft-yellow);
border:1px solid rgba(255,204,41,.45);
border-radius:999px;
font-size:12px;
font-weight:700;
color:#5e4a00;
letter-spacing:.02em;
text-transform:uppercase;
}

.title{
margin:18px 0 8px 0;
font-size:30px;
line-height:1.15;
font-weight:800;
color:var(--tcu-blue);
}

.subtitle{
margin:0;
font-size:15px;
line-height:1.6;
color:#334155;
max-width:720px;
}

.content{
padding:28px 32px 32px 32px;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
gap:20px;
}

@media (max-width:760px){
.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.header,.content{padding:22px 18px}
.title{font-size:24px}
}

.alert{
display:flex;
gap:12px;
align-items:flex-start;
padding:14px 16px;
border-radius:12px;
background:var(--soft-blue);
border:1px solid #d7e5fb;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.alert .icon{
flex:0 0 auto;
width:28px;
height:28px;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--tcu-blue);
color:#fff;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-weight:700;
font-size:16px;
}

.alert p{
margin:0;
font-size:14px;
line-height:1.6;
color:#24364d;
}

.request-box{
margin-top:8px;
padding:16px;
border-radius:12px;
background:var(--soft-green);
border-left:5px solid var(--tcu-green);
border-top:1px solid #d5efde;
border-right:1px solid #d5efde;
border-bottom:1px solid #d5efde;
}

.label{
font-size:12px;
font-weight:800;
letter-spacing:.03em;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:var(--muted);
margin-bottom:8px;
}

.rid{
display:block;
font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,"Liberation Mono","Courier New",monospace;
font-size:18px;
font-weight:700;
color:var(--tcu-blue-dark);
word-break:break-word;
margin-bottom:14px;
}

.actions{
display:flex;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:10px;
margin-top:4px;
}

.btn{
appearance:none;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
padding:11px 16px;
font-size:14px;
font-weight:700;
cursor:pointer;
transition:all .2s ease;
text-decoration:none;
display:inline-flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
min-width:130px;
}

.btn-primary{
background:var(--tcu-green);
color:#fff;
}

.btn-primary:hover{
background:var(--tcu-green-dark);
}

.btn-ghost{
background:#fff;
color:var(--tcu-blue);
border:1px solid var(--border);
}

.btn-ghost:hover{
background:#f8fbff;
}

.btn.copied{
background:var(--tcu-blue-dark)!important;
color:#fff!important;
cursor:default;
}

.panel{
border:1px solid var(--border);
border-radius:14px;
background:#fff;
padding:18px;
}

.panel h2{
margin:0 0 12px 0;
font-size:17px;
color:var(--tcu-blue);
}

.list{
margin:0;
padding-left:18px;
}

.list li{
margin:0 0 10px 0;
line-height:1.55;
font-size:14px;
color:#334155;
}

.note{
margin-top:16px;
padding:12px 14px;
font-size:13px;
line-height:1.55;
background:var(--soft-yellow);
border:1px solid rgba(255,204,41,.45);
border-radius:12px;
color:#5a4b0d;
}

.footer{
padding:16px 32px 24px 32px;
border-top:1px solid var(--border);
font-size:12px;
color:var(--muted);
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
gap:12px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
background:#fcfdff;
}

@media (max-width:760px){
.footer{padding:16px 18px 24px 18px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="topbar"></div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="card">

    <div class="header">
      <div class="brand">
        <img src="https://logodownload.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tcu-logo-tribunal-de-contas-da-uniao.png"
             alt="Tribunal de Contas da União"
             width="190">
        <span class="badge">Proteção de Aplicações Web</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="title">Acesso Bloqueado por Segurança</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Sua requisição foi interrompida pelos mecanismos de proteção do
        <strong>Tribunal de Contas da União</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <div class="alert">
            <div class="icon">!</div>
            <p>
              Caso o bloqueio seja considerado indevido, entre em contato com a
              <strong>Central de Atendimento ao Usuário</strong>, pelo telefone
              <strong>0800-644-1500</strong>, <strong>opção 2</strong>, e informe o código de identificação abaixo.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="request-box">
            <div class="label">ID da Requisição / Support ID</div>
            <span class="rid" id="rid">E_8560639475823864740</span>

            <div class="actions">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" id="copyBtn" onclick="copySupportId()">Copiar ID</button>
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="javascript:history.back();">Voltar</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="panel">
            <h2>O que fazer agora</h2>
            <ol class="list">
              <li>Confirme se a URL acessada está correta.</li>
              <li>Evite repetir a mesma ação em alta frequência.</li>
              <li>Revise parâmetros enviados em formulários ou links.</li>
              <li>Acione o suporte informando o Support ID exibido.</li>
            </ol>

            <div class="note">
              O Support ID permite localizar o evento correspondente no sistema de proteção.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div><strong>TCU</strong> - Tribunal de Contas da União</div>
      <div>© 2026 Todos os direitos reservados</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<script>
function copySupportId(){
  var rid = document.getElementById('rid').innerText;
  var btn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');

  if (!rid) return;

  if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(rid).then(function(){
      btn.innerText = "ID copiado ✔";
      btn.classList.add("copied");
      btn.disabled = true;
    }).catch(function(){
      fallbackCopy(rid, btn);
    });
  } else {
    fallbackCopy(rid, btn);
  }
}

function fallbackCopy(text, btn){
  var temp = document.createElement('textarea');
  temp.value = text;
  temp.setAttribute('readonly', '');
  temp.style.position = 'absolute';
  temp.style.left = '-9999px';
  document.body.appendChild(temp);
  temp.select();

  try{
    document.execCommand('copy');
    btn.innerText = "ID copiado ✔";
    btn.classList.add("copied");
    btn.disabled = true;
  }catch(e){
    btn.innerText = "Copie manualmente";
  }

  document.body.removeChild(temp);
}
</script>
</body>
</html>